                        "glosses": [
                            "góra o wysokości przekraczającej osiem tysięcy metrów n.p.m."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6ddad834-d9e0-40b5-a074-3b5abca2480b",
                                "sense_id": "f53869b1-2315-321e-9d17-f4ffdfba867d",
                                "text": "Polski himalaista zdobył kolejny ośmiotysięcznik."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "72aa00d4-15e3-4fa5-8315-e85aeb7ff644",
                        "source_entry_id": "cefa10bb-aa9d-3ee2-85aa-d06e8694440a",
                        "source_sense_id": "f53869b1-2315-321e-9d17-f4ffdfba867d",
                        "target_lang_word": "eight-thousander",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "eight-thousander",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dc6226cd-e64f-32d3-8fda-6261c5d466ae",
                                        "entry_id": "8e581e24-0cf7-3837-a661-00a3c0b5edf1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of the fourteen independent mountains on Earth, all located in Asia, that extend more than 8,000 metres (26,247 ft) above sea level."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c65cd9e8-2a18-4416-a723-f2619e570b5b",
                                                "sense_id": "dc6226cd-e64f-32d3-8fda-6261c5d466ae",
                                                "text": "The challenge we had set ourselves was to climb this eight-thousander as a twosome, without a large expedition, without high-altitude porters or oxygen gear..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "12d9745d-49e8-4dad-bd23-8daeed8a9a8e",
                                                "sense_id": "dc6226cd-e64f-32d3-8fda-6261c5d466ae",
                                                "text": "But most readers will guffaw at the commentary from Messner's waifish young companion, Sabine Stehle (\"to basecamp on three eight thousander expeditions\")."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3abdb854-7b64-4985-8872-8c181e0096f9",
                                                "sense_id": "dc6226cd-e64f-32d3-8fda-6261c5d466ae",
                                                "text": "From then on I have been waiting for a new opportunity to enjoy them more intensively than through a view from the summit of an eight-thousander."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e4ebed12-aa76-460a-9289-328f403540dd",
                                                "sense_id": "dc6226cd-e64f-32d3-8fda-6261c5d466ae",
                                                "text": "If you judge countries purely by their mountainous terrain, Finland is a bit of a loser. Halti, Finland's tallest, is around 1,324 meters, or about 4,340 feet, making it a \"one-thousander\" as it is over a thousand meters above sea level. That may sound impressive, but bear in mind that the tallest peak in the United States is a six-thousander and Mount Everest is a eight-thousander."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fd485135-ddac-432a-bfa9-8639b5682a83",
                        "source_entry_id": "cefa10bb-aa9d-3ee2-85aa-d06e8694440a",
                        "source_sense_id": "f53869b1-2315-321e-9d17-f4ffdfba867d",
